WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.994
"When watching TV, keep the lights on,
and don't sit too close to the set, okay?"

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:17.444
I pretended to be his follower
and waited for my chance...

00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:20.113
And at last I found it!!

00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:26.119
From this year, for some
reason he suddenly got soft!

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:28.622
Now I'm gonna reach the top.

00:00:28.622 --> 00:00:30.817
If I'm gonna crush him,
now's the time!

00:00:33.126 --> 00:00:34.461
Oh...

00:00:34.461 --> 00:00:35.962
Whiskers, lead.

00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:38.226
- Huh?
- Harima-kun.

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:46.139
What? 2B? Don't you have HB?

00:00:46.139 --> 00:00:48.308
This is useless!

00:00:48.308 --> 00:00:49.172
Here.

00:00:50.143 --> 00:00:52.543
- Thank you!
- Oh, sure.

00:00:56.817 --> 00:00:58.910
What? Any complaints?

00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:01.488
No, not especially.

00:01:01.488 --> 00:01:04.925
Out with it. Be a man and speak up!

00:01:04.925 --> 00:01:07.594
Really. There's no problem.

00:01:07.594 --> 00:01:08.762
Dammit.

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:13.266
He's cozying up to Ms. Sawachika,
the girl I secretly like!

00:01:13.266 --> 00:01:16.169
But the bastard is definitely weaker.

00:01:16.169 --> 00:01:17.227
Here goes.

00:01:18.772 --> 00:01:20.774
The first step to secure my future,

00:01:20.774 --> 00:01:23.766
show disrespect by saying, "Yo, Harima!"

00:01:26.046 --> 00:01:29.249
Yo... Yo...

00:01:29.249 --> 00:01:32.786
"Doki, doki... Hara, hara..."
[pounding heart and shaking knees]
Yo, Harima, did you find a nice bike?

00:01:32.786 --> 00:01:34.588
"Doki, doki... Hara, hara..."
[pounding heart and shaking knees]
Yeah. This one looks pretty cool.

00:01:34.588 --> 00:01:35.121
Yeah. This one looks pretty cool.

00:01:35.121 --> 00:01:36.122
Eh?

00:01:36.122 --> 00:01:40.460
Yay!! I'm finally in with Harima!!

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:44.396
I've made a crucial step in
my move to the top!!

00:01:44.631 --> 00:01:48.134
And in front of Ms. Sawachika, too!

00:01:48.134 --> 00:01:50.470
Eee! I'm so cool!!

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.138
Let's go see Akira-chan!

00:01:52.138 --> 00:01:53.807
- Yeah.
- Eh?

00:01:53.807 --> 00:01:56.476
You know that banana rice cake?

00:01:56.476 --> 00:01:57.807
Is it good?

00:01:58.879 --> 00:02:03.583
Let's have a man-to-man talk,
huh, Harima?

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:04.618
Tenma-chan!

00:02:04.618 --> 00:02:06.483
I'm gonna borrow your seat!

00:02:08.255 --> 00:02:11.091
Don't get familiar!
Cut out the names!!

00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:12.592
Oh, no!

00:02:12.592 --> 00:02:15.095
I forgot something!

00:02:15.095 --> 00:02:17.764
Wow, cool...

00:02:17.764 --> 00:02:20.494
Am I ever gonna get there?

00:02:27.274 --> 00:02:34.281
There's something I want
to tell you, but it's too heavy

00:02:34.281 --> 00:02:39.981
Just like this, it seems I must break

00:02:42.289 --> 00:02:49.429
There are too many of
these indescribable feelings

00:02:49.429 --> 00:02:56.028
I cannot deliver them to you, though
you are near, the distance is great

00:02:57.604 --> 00:03:04.744
Forever only looking up
at the blue sky is no good

00:03:04.744 --> 00:03:12.218
Spinning around (spinning around)...
Spinning around (spinning around)...

00:03:12.218 --> 00:03:19.459
Unsteadily mustering strength,
I want to try diving into your heart

00:03:19.459 --> 00:03:26.900
Spinning around (spinning around)...
Spinning around (spinning around)...

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:36.104
Lightly floating, again today
I am alone above the clouds

00:03:50.757 --> 00:03:55.762
"Was Burger, Karen Ichijou
at her part-time job"

00:03:55.762 --> 00:04:00.699
"Right now, Dojibiron souvenirs
come with the burgers!"

00:04:02.769 --> 00:04:05.738
"After the Athletic Meet"

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.298
Welcome!

00:04:09.609 --> 00:04:13.246
One Was meal? Thank you.

00:04:13.246 --> 00:04:15.237
One Was meal, please!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.391
Huh? How come there's a line
at this register?

00:04:24.391 --> 00:04:26.993
The next one's open.

00:04:26.993 --> 00:04:28.595
Weird...

00:04:28.595 --> 00:04:31.765
Well, I'm lucky that it's open.

00:04:31.765 --> 00:04:33.289
Let's see...

00:04:34.768 --> 00:04:35.564
Huh?

00:04:39.005 --> 00:04:40.373
S-Scary.

00:04:40.373 --> 00:04:42.609
What's she so mad about?

00:04:42.609 --> 00:04:43.701
What'll it be?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:47.678
A smile.

00:04:49.449 --> 00:04:51.284
A smile don't cost nothin', right?

00:04:51.284 --> 00:04:53.844
C'mon, let's see you smile.

00:05:00.393 --> 00:05:01.985
She slammed him down!

00:05:04.731 --> 00:05:06.733
What're you doing, Lala-chan!?

00:05:06.733 --> 00:05:10.236
I-I'm terribly sorry.
Please wait a moment!

00:05:10.236 --> 00:05:12.906
L-Lala-san, don't! He's a customer!

00:05:12.906 --> 00:05:16.943
I-Ichijou... do something
about this girl...

00:05:16.943 --> 00:05:18.912
Break! Break!

00:05:18.912 --> 00:05:21.081
Break it up!

00:05:21.081 --> 00:05:25.085
That Lala's pretty worked up, though.

00:05:25.085 --> 00:05:29.255
She's still bummed about losing to Ichijou
at the Athletic Meet, probably.

00:05:29.255 --> 00:05:31.591
Your fries are getting cold, pal.

00:05:31.591 --> 00:05:32.990
Don't call me "pal."

00:05:33.927 --> 00:05:36.725
She might go back to Mexico.

00:05:42.769 --> 00:05:45.505
Lala-chan, here's your usual.

00:05:45.505 --> 00:05:47.273
Leftover burgers.

00:05:47.273 --> 00:05:50.276
Try to smile a little more tomorrow.

00:05:50.276 --> 00:05:52.938
Don't let Ms. Ichijou outdo you.

00:06:02.555 --> 00:06:05.558
Um... Cheer up, Lala-san.

00:06:05.558 --> 00:06:08.220
Every person has trouble
doing something.

00:06:11.064 --> 00:06:15.262
I think you'd look cute
if you smiled, though.

00:06:19.906 --> 00:06:22.075
Sis!

00:06:22.075 --> 00:06:23.838
Kousuke! What's up?

00:06:25.912 --> 00:06:26.936
Hup!

00:06:27.747 --> 00:06:29.516
I came to walk you home!

00:06:29.516 --> 00:06:31.417
Really? Thanks!

00:06:31.417 --> 00:06:34.784
Hurry. "Dojibiron" is
gonna start soon! Huh?

00:06:43.096 --> 00:06:46.933
Tall girl!! Are you
the Evil Queen in Dojibiron?!

00:06:46.933 --> 00:06:48.768
Eh!? Hey, Kousuke!

00:06:48.768 --> 00:06:50.736
I'll take you down! Come on!

00:06:53.606 --> 00:06:57.443
- I-I'm sorry, Lala-san! Good-bye.
- Leggo! Let go of me!

00:06:57.443 --> 00:07:00.469
- Evil Queen! I'll take you down!
- A...

00:07:01.381 --> 00:07:03.550
Adios...

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:05.347
Family...

00:07:22.902 --> 00:07:23.891
What?

00:07:31.744 --> 00:07:33.211
Want this?

00:07:43.756 --> 00:07:45.592
Good?

00:07:45.592 --> 00:07:46.889
Eat up!

00:07:51.097 --> 00:07:53.463
You alone, too?

00:07:57.704 --> 00:07:59.069
That tickles!

00:08:10.717 --> 00:08:12.309
Welcome!

00:08:15.722 --> 00:08:17.019
Smile.

00:08:20.893 --> 00:08:23.896
You! Whaddya want?!

00:08:23.896 --> 00:08:26.228
A smile like yesterday's.

00:08:34.741 --> 00:08:37.410
Ichijou, save me!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.079
Forgive him, already, Lala-chan!

00:08:40.079 --> 00:08:42.415
I-Imadori-san, are you all right?!

00:08:42.415 --> 00:08:43.916
She seems happy.

00:08:43.916 --> 00:08:46.686
Her punches are sharper
than yesterday.

00:08:46.686 --> 00:08:48.881
Looks like we won't
have to come anymore.

00:08:49.756 --> 00:08:52.224
Break! Break!

00:09:19.552 --> 00:09:21.452
"Prehistoric Rumble"

00:09:22.055 --> 00:09:25.892
"Narration, Jin Kobayashi"
The time is over 10,000 years ago
in the primitive ages.

00:09:25.892 --> 00:09:30.396
"Narration, Jin Kobayashi"
It is not clear whether earthenware
or stoneware existed in this period.

00:09:30.396 --> 00:09:34.230
"Narration, Jin Kobayashi"
But man definitely existed.

00:09:36.736 --> 00:09:39.872
Roll a rope over this,
and a pattern appears.

00:09:39.872 --> 00:09:42.608
Cute! It'll probably be popular.

00:09:42.608 --> 00:09:44.735
You've got great taste, Yakumo.

00:09:45.745 --> 00:09:47.480
What's that?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.414
Draw a picture on a leaf and...

00:09:51.918 --> 00:09:53.586
Awesome!

00:09:53.586 --> 00:09:56.923
I invented it. I call it "anime."

00:09:56.923 --> 00:09:59.092
Awesome! What fun! What fun!

00:09:59.092 --> 00:10:01.094
I'm starving!

00:10:01.094 --> 00:10:03.763
Don't say that.
It makes me even hungrier.

00:10:03.763 --> 00:10:05.264
It can't be helped.

00:10:05.264 --> 00:10:08.267
Pickings in the hills
were slim this year.

00:10:08.267 --> 00:10:11.270
But at this rate,
we'll all starve to death.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.939
- B-Big trouble!!
- Huh?

00:10:12.939 --> 00:10:15.806
- H-Hanai is...
- Huh?

00:10:22.115 --> 00:10:24.948
Man... What could've...

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.485
He was a bossy busybody, but...

00:10:40.967 --> 00:10:42.366
Fire...

00:10:43.136 --> 00:10:44.330
Fire...

00:10:50.476 --> 00:10:51.644
Hot!!

00:10:51.644 --> 00:10:54.947
- Hey, he's alive!
- Who's the jerk
that proclaimed him dead?!

00:10:54.947 --> 00:10:57.817
Hot! Hot, hot, hot... hot!!

00:10:57.817 --> 00:10:59.919
Oh... He is alive, after all.

00:10:59.919 --> 00:11:01.682
Water! Bring water!

00:11:06.092 --> 00:11:07.923
What happened, anyway, Hanai?

00:11:09.095 --> 00:11:10.426
Well, actually...

00:11:11.864 --> 00:11:13.764
I went into the woods
in search of food.

00:11:17.437 --> 00:11:21.707
I found some fruit and climbed
the tree to pick it...

00:11:21.707 --> 00:11:23.937
Yow! Oop, oop!

00:11:25.111 --> 00:11:25.839
Huh?

00:11:32.785 --> 00:11:35.188
It was a stupendous giant mammoth.

00:11:35.188 --> 00:11:37.290
Giant mammoth?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.552
Devil Tusk.

00:11:40.626 --> 00:11:45.631
The ancient evil told of by
the people of Yagami Village.

00:11:45.631 --> 00:11:47.360
This has become a crisis.

00:11:50.803 --> 00:11:54.640
Devil Tusk... That evil has appeared?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.109
Yes, there seems to be no mistake.

00:11:57.109 --> 00:11:58.644
This is terrible.

00:11:58.644 --> 00:12:01.977
At this rate, the entire village
will starve to death.

00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:05.585
As your queen, I order...

00:12:05.585 --> 00:12:07.587
Hold a meeting to discuss
countermeasures!

00:12:07.587 --> 00:12:09.077
Right!

00:12:14.427 --> 00:12:16.929
There, I made a good drawing today.

00:12:16.929 --> 00:12:21.100
This black stone I found in
the hills is good and hard.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.336
Huh? The tone here is a little...

00:12:23.336 --> 00:12:25.896
What's "tone"? What am I talking about?

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.102
Tenma-chan, I love ya, Baby.

00:12:31.444 --> 00:12:33.779
The first problem is
the mammoth's hide!

00:12:33.779 --> 00:12:37.283
It's so tough, our stone weapons
can't make a dent in it!

00:12:37.283 --> 00:12:40.119
Why don't we just abandon the area?

00:12:40.119 --> 00:12:42.989
People, just follow me, Hanai!

00:12:42.989 --> 00:12:44.156
Not me.

00:12:44.156 --> 00:12:44.857
Huh?

00:12:44.857 --> 00:12:48.728
I love these mountains and streams.

00:12:48.728 --> 00:12:49.795
Bastard!

00:12:49.795 --> 00:12:52.899
What if we had a harder stone?

00:12:52.899 --> 00:12:55.527
Ah, there's no such stone.

00:12:57.637 --> 00:12:58.569
Huh?

00:13:00.907 --> 00:13:03.743
I wanna eat a buffet meal!!
What's a "buffet"?

00:13:03.743 --> 00:13:05.244
Tenma-chan!

00:13:05.244 --> 00:13:07.413
She can't move, because she hasn't eaten?

00:13:07.413 --> 00:13:08.581
The poor thing!

00:13:08.581 --> 00:13:12.919
Ahh... I'm hungry, Harima-kun...

00:13:12.919 --> 00:13:14.587
All right!

00:13:14.587 --> 00:13:16.255
Uh... Excuse me...

00:13:16.255 --> 00:13:18.591
Huh? Oh, Harima!

00:13:18.591 --> 00:13:20.927
What're you doing in our village?

00:13:20.927 --> 00:13:23.429
You were banished, weren't you?

00:13:23.429 --> 00:13:27.889
You were too violent and stupid,
so our queen ordered you banished.

00:13:37.276 --> 00:13:39.111
This is it!

00:13:39.111 --> 00:13:41.213
Everyone! Please listen!

00:13:41.213 --> 00:13:42.448
Harima!

00:13:42.448 --> 00:13:47.119
This black stone I found is harder
than any other thus far!

00:13:47.119 --> 00:13:51.457
With weapons made from this stone,
we should be able to defeat Devil Tusk!

00:13:51.457 --> 00:13:53.459
What's Harima talking about?!

00:13:53.459 --> 00:13:55.127
What are we supposed
to do with a stone?!

00:13:55.127 --> 00:13:58.965
If we could kill Devil Tusk with a stone,
we wouldn't have a problem!

00:13:58.965 --> 00:14:00.626
Wanna roast sweet potatoes?!

00:14:03.235 --> 00:14:05.438
What's a roasted sweet potato?

00:14:05.438 --> 00:14:08.574
No, Harima might be right.

00:14:08.574 --> 00:14:10.076
Huh?

00:14:10.076 --> 00:14:12.578
Oh!! Soothsayer!!

00:14:12.578 --> 00:14:15.915
Use that black stone
to reinforce our weapons.

00:14:15.915 --> 00:14:18.284
I think it's worth a try.

00:14:18.284 --> 00:14:19.919
All right! We'll do it!

00:14:19.919 --> 00:14:22.922
- All right!
- You're awesome, Harima-kun!

00:14:22.922 --> 00:14:26.289
Huh? No... I didn't do much...

00:14:26.759 --> 00:14:29.328
Yes-s-ss!!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.213
We're off!!

00:14:50.116 --> 00:14:54.177
All right! I'll make a big impression,
and Tenma-chan will be mine!

00:14:55.121 --> 00:14:58.591
Papa! Kill a nice dinner, please!

00:14:58.591 --> 00:15:00.059
Right! Leave it to me!

00:15:00.059 --> 00:15:01.390
Papa, good luck!

00:15:01.961 --> 00:15:03.396
Good luck.

00:15:03.396 --> 00:15:04.795
Goo, goo.

00:15:06.065 --> 00:15:07.191
Ha...

00:15:08.234 --> 00:15:09.292
All right, all right.

00:15:09.902 --> 00:15:12.735
Just wait! My children!

00:15:15.408 --> 00:15:19.174
All these young men risking
their lives for the village...

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:24.072
This, too, was accomplished by my beauty.

00:15:25.584 --> 00:15:31.045
Men! There is no need to fear!!
Don't worry, just follow me, Hanai!

00:15:31.757 --> 00:15:34.658
Hey, did you finish the new anime?

00:15:35.261 --> 00:15:36.694
My family!

00:15:38.264 --> 00:15:39.253
Yeh.

00:15:43.936 --> 00:15:45.130
He's coming!

00:15:57.283 --> 00:15:59.774
Charge!

00:16:11.397 --> 00:16:13.733
Use the weapons of black stone!

00:16:13.733 --> 00:16:15.132
Right!

00:16:33.753 --> 00:16:35.421
It didn't work, after all!

00:16:35.421 --> 00:16:37.223
That's why I told them to follow me!

00:16:37.223 --> 00:16:39.248
No, don't give up!

00:16:47.099 --> 00:16:48.934
Whoa!

00:16:48.934 --> 00:16:52.271
Wow! He pierced
the thick skin of Devil Tusk!

00:16:52.271 --> 00:16:54.440
Awesome, Harima!

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.898
I did it! Now Tenma-chan's heart is mine!

00:17:04.049 --> 00:17:05.718
Ichi-jou! Now!!

00:17:05.718 --> 00:17:06.810
Right!

00:17:12.057 --> 00:17:13.217
Huh?

00:17:21.567 --> 00:17:22.902
We did it!

00:17:22.902 --> 00:17:25.571
Gallant Lala and Ichi-jou
took him down!

00:17:25.571 --> 00:17:28.073
Now! Get him now!!

00:17:28.073 --> 00:17:30.735
Yeah!

00:17:37.583 --> 00:17:40.252
This is so good!

00:17:40.252 --> 00:17:41.086
Yeah!

00:17:41.086 --> 00:17:43.422
Man, thank goodness!

00:17:43.422 --> 00:17:45.024
Now we can survive the winter.

00:17:45.024 --> 00:17:47.760
We owe it all to Lala and Ichi-jou!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.263
Come! Let's all cheer
for these brave women!!

00:17:51.263 --> 00:17:52.696
Great job, girls!!

00:17:57.269 --> 00:17:58.793
Uh... um...

00:18:07.546 --> 00:18:11.050
I guess I'm just
a roughneck. Oh, well.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:14.247
At least Tenma-chan
has a full belly now.

00:18:15.387 --> 00:18:17.223
- Knock, knock.
- Huh?

00:18:17.223 --> 00:18:19.258
T-Tenma-chan!

00:18:19.258 --> 00:18:21.021
You worked hard,
didn't you, Harima-kun?

00:18:21.894 --> 00:18:24.230
Here! This is your share.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.221
T-Tenma-chan...

00:18:31.871 --> 00:18:34.506
Come on, Harima-kun.
There's still some nose left!

00:18:34.506 --> 00:18:37.076
- Oh, right!
- Yahoo!

00:18:37.076 --> 00:18:39.306
I've got to record this emotion!

00:18:40.746 --> 00:18:44.079
Ohh. A perfect jewel...

00:18:45.084 --> 00:18:47.753
If we work together,
we can do anything, can't we?

00:18:47.753 --> 00:18:49.822
Yeah! Because we're friends!

00:18:49.822 --> 00:18:54.760
When I'm reborn, I have a feeling
we'll all be classmates together!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.762
What're "classmates"?

00:18:56.762 --> 00:18:58.753
It's just a feeling I have.

00:18:59.765 --> 00:19:05.004
This cave drawing is from the primitive age,
and it's called "Smiling Venus."

00:19:05.004 --> 00:19:08.240
This looks like you a little, Sis...

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.867
Huh!? You think so?

00:19:13.712 --> 00:19:16.647
"On the last day to enter the
Manga New Artist Award Contest"

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:26.225
Cap'n... I'm gonna do it.

00:19:26.225 --> 00:19:27.393
Harima-san?

00:19:27.393 --> 00:19:31.730
A-Ah, sorry! Will you hand me
that French curve?

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.254
Oh... yes.

00:19:36.568 --> 00:19:37.069
Here you are.

00:19:37.069 --> 00:19:38.127
Thanks.

00:19:41.073 --> 00:19:43.709
I-I'm sorry! The thunder scared me!

00:19:43.709 --> 00:19:46.234
Oh, it's okay. I'll get it.

00:19:59.925 --> 00:20:01.927
Th-Thank you.

00:20:01.927 --> 00:20:04.157
Oh... you're welcome.

00:20:05.764 --> 00:20:09.268
B-Blackout, huh? Just like that!

00:20:09.268 --> 00:20:11.470
Candle... candle...

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.439
Crud, at a time like this, too...

00:20:13.439 --> 00:20:18.444
Gah. Even touching a girl's hand by
accident really makes my heart pound.

00:20:18.444 --> 00:20:22.642
At this rate, if I touched
Tenma-chan's hand, I'd probably die.

00:20:30.956 --> 00:20:32.458
Quiet, isn't it?

00:20:32.458 --> 00:20:33.823
Wanna listen to the radio?

00:20:36.128 --> 00:20:38.630
Is everybody scared
with all the lights out?

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:40.632
DJ Yoshimo is fine!

00:20:40.632 --> 00:20:44.970
At a time like this, making out
with a girl is the best.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.464
Yoshimo will give you tips on how to put
the moves on a girl. Listen up, now...

00:20:52.144 --> 00:20:55.011
We can work better if it's quiet.

00:20:55.981 --> 00:20:58.984
Uh! Did you want to listen
to that program?

00:20:58.984 --> 00:21:00.586
N-No!

00:21:00.586 --> 00:21:05.424
I-I'm sorry I made you help me, though...
till so late at night.

00:21:05.424 --> 00:21:10.293
Oh, but I wanted to see
your finished work right away...

00:21:11.096 --> 00:21:12.698
Uh!

00:21:12.698 --> 00:21:13.766
Younger Sister...

00:21:13.766 --> 00:21:14.767
Yes?

00:21:14.767 --> 00:21:16.769
Won't you stay that way for a moment?

00:21:16.769 --> 00:21:17.758
Huh?

00:21:21.106 --> 00:21:24.109
I see! This is the lighting!

00:21:24.109 --> 00:21:27.646
So! This is how it looks!

00:21:27.646 --> 00:21:28.781
Huh?

00:21:28.781 --> 00:21:30.849
In my manga,

00:21:30.849 --> 00:21:34.620
there's a scene in a cave where
the hero and heroine build a fire.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:39.291
I just couldn't picture it,
until I saw your face!

00:21:39.291 --> 00:21:40.459
Thanks a lot!

00:21:40.459 --> 00:21:41.293
I know!

00:21:41.293 --> 00:21:44.763
While we're at it, won't you read
the dialogue from this scene?

00:21:44.763 --> 00:21:46.632
I'll see it much more clearly!

00:21:46.632 --> 00:21:47.792
Okay...

00:21:48.967 --> 00:21:51.970
"We're finally all alone on this
deserted island, aren't we?"

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.506
That's it!! That's the feeling!

00:21:54.506 --> 00:21:57.643
Wow! This will really help!

00:21:57.643 --> 00:21:59.778
You're quite an actress,
aren't you, Younger Sister?

00:21:59.778 --> 00:22:01.680
A-Am I?

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.916
Now try the next line.

00:22:03.916 --> 00:22:05.747
Huh? Uh... yes...

00:22:07.252 --> 00:22:09.755
"I'm glad I'm all alone with you."

00:22:09.755 --> 00:22:13.926
Right, right. Good... good!
Read the next line!

00:22:13.926 --> 00:22:17.429
"But what will become of us now?"

00:22:17.429 --> 00:22:20.966
Don't worry! Rest assured!
I'll always protect you!

00:22:20.966 --> 00:22:23.268
Huh? H-Harima-san?

00:22:23.268 --> 00:22:27.306
M-Maybe I should just
keep reading... after all...

00:22:27.306 --> 00:22:30.109
Huh? This line is...

00:22:30.109 --> 00:22:34.279
"I... I... I love..."

00:22:34.279 --> 00:22:36.713
Yes! I love you, too!!

00:22:37.616 --> 00:22:40.786
I promise you! I'll make you happy!

00:22:40.786 --> 00:22:43.122
Uh... uh... Harima-san,
I think we should...

00:22:43.122 --> 00:22:45.691
We'll make a happy family together!

00:22:45.691 --> 00:22:46.783
He's not listening...

00:22:56.635 --> 00:22:57.803
Harima-kun...

00:22:57.803 --> 00:23:00.499
T-Tenma-chan...

00:23:05.077 --> 00:23:07.579
All of a sudden, he's quiet.

00:23:07.579 --> 00:23:10.015
Could I have offended him?

00:23:10.015 --> 00:23:10.816
Huh?

00:23:10.816 --> 00:23:14.920
"C-Cute. Tenma"

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:16.755
Oh... I see...

00:23:16.755 --> 00:23:18.590
Wh-What's wrong?

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:20.592
N-Nothing in particular...

00:23:20.592 --> 00:23:24.096
S-Sorry. I got carried away.

00:23:24.096 --> 00:23:26.496
C'mon, let's continue,
with the drawings.

00:23:28.934 --> 00:23:31.402
Was it... my imagination?

00:23:40.779 --> 00:23:44.917
Do you dislike men?
Or do you like them?

00:23:44.917 --> 00:23:45.645
Huh?

00:23:59.064 --> 00:24:05.003
Boys are always chasing after girls.

00:24:05.003 --> 00:24:10.909
All day long they're thinking of girls.

00:24:10.909 --> 00:24:15.347
But those boys certainly
are a little stupid,

00:24:15.347 --> 00:24:20.080
They never seem to
understand girls' feelings.

00:24:22.454 --> 00:24:25.591
Hey, you really really are a big dummy.

00:24:25.591 --> 00:24:28.293
Shall I give you a lesson, Big Dummy?

00:24:28.293 --> 00:24:31.630
So, the most important thing
in the world is...

00:24:31.630 --> 00:24:34.600
The thing that absolutely must be...

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:40.105
It's definitely "timing", you see?

00:24:40.105 --> 00:24:45.944
So, if you wanna say "I love you",
go on a date, or do something...

00:24:45.944 --> 00:24:51.950
Oh, kiss, or say goodbye, at any time...

00:24:51.950 --> 00:24:55.354
Yes, the most important thing
in the world is...

00:24:55.354 --> 00:25:00.225
...definitely "timing", I think, but...

00:25:00.225 --> 00:25:01.226
Or something.

00:25:01.226 --> 00:25:05.397
La la lalalala lalala la lalalala lalala

00:25:05.397 --> 00:25:07.099
la lala la la la

00:25:07.099 --> 00:25:11.470
la la lalalala lalala la lalalala lalala

00:25:11.470 --> 00:25:13.165
la lala la lala

00:25:17.242 --> 00:25:18.243
It's the School Festival!

00:25:18.243 --> 00:25:20.412
Our class is arguing over
doing a coffee shop or a booth,

00:25:20.412 --> 00:25:23.715
and deciding how to choose...
I already read this!

00:25:23.715 --> 00:25:24.716
Ms. Tsukamoto, this time,
it's for real.

00:25:24.716 --> 00:25:25.917
"Suit Won."
Ms. Tsukamoto, this time,
it's for real.

00:25:25.917 --> 00:25:27.119
"Suit Won."
Huhhh?!

00:25:27.119 --> 00:25:30.689
School Rumble, 2nd Term! It's starting?

00:25:30.689 --> 00:25:35.694
"You think it's another lie, don't you?"

00:25:35.694 --> 00:25:40.699
"Well, then, when spring comes,
let's meet again, okay?!"

00:25:40.699 --> 00:25:43.199
"THE END"
